p08 : US Blanks 9'4"B (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 92.8 L)
p97 : From the original 9’4”B plug, with thickness added to the tail area of the deck to make it a more shaper friendly blank, close tolerance for strength, will net 24” x 3 1 / “. 8 Bottom rockers from the previous 9’4”B will work well with this blank.
